  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "一个点，发出的是圈圈的波",
      "t0": 2.2,
      "t1": 7.0,
      "x": 140,
      "y": 986,
      "size": 30,
      "family": "NotoSerifSC",
      "weight": 300
    },
    {
      "text": "透镜把波收成一个焦点",
      "t0": 9.0,
      "t1": 13.4,
      "x": 140,
      "y": 986,
      "size": 30,
      "family": "NotoSerifSC",
      "weight": 300
    },
    {
      "text": "可焦点不是一个点，是一个斑",
      "t0": 14.3,
      "t1": 19.0,
      "x": 140,
      "y": 986,
      "size": 30,
      "family": "NotoSerifSC",
      "weight": 300
    },
    {
      "text": "两个点靠得太近，只剩一团",
      "t0": 23.5,
      "t1": 29.0,
      "x": 140,
      "y": 986,
      "size": 30,
      "family": "NotoSerifSC",
      "weight": 300
    },
    {
      "text": "模糊里还有信息，只是没人读",
      "t0": 30.2,
      "t1": 36.0,
      "x": 140,
      "y": 986,
      "size": 30,
      "family": "NotoSerifSC",
      "weight": 300
    },
    {
      "text": "神经网络一层层把它读回来",
      "t0": 36.6,
      "t1": 43.0,
      "x": 140,
      "y": 986,
      "size": 30,
      "family": "NotoSerifSC",
      "weight": 300
    },
    {
      "text": "不是超过光的极限，是把信息读出来",
      "t0": 43.8,
      "t1": 47.2,
      "x": 140,
